"<a "
"href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/index.php/OpenStreetMap_License\">Creative "
"Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.0 license</a>. Usage of the MapQuest "
"routing service is subject to the <a "
"href=\"https://info.mapquest.com/terms-of-use/\">MapQuest terms of "
"use</a>.</p>"
msgstr "<p><i>MapQuest</i><br />Neke od ruta koje se koriste u Marble putem preuzimanja osigurava <a href=\"https://www.mapquest.com/\">MapQuest</a> i njihovi Open Data Map API-ji i web-usluge.<br />Upute zahvaljujući MapQuest rade na OpenStreetMap podacima koji se mogu koristiti slobodno pod uvjetima licence <a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/index.php/OpenStreetMap_License\">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.0</a>. Korištenje MapQuest usluge usmjeravanja podliježe <a href=\"https://info.mapquest.com/terms-of-use/\">MapQuest uvjetima korištenja</a>.</p>"

